5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,We need a system that actually works for daily use. I'll look into the state of the car at handover and trips that repeat weekly.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,I'm tired of the scheduling headaches. I'll check the month's trial of recording every run and weeks of heavy use over the year.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,"To be fair, we must understand the true costs. I will examine last year's tax, insurance and parking papers and last year's fuel receipts.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I want to know why we're arguing. I'll look at what two other car-sharing households said and the spell of checking each other's figures.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I want the real numbers too! I'll check the hours of use recorded in the diary and the mechanic's remarks at the last service.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
