30,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"It's worse than I thought. The car is often left dirty or empty, and our weekly routines are the first things to fail.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,May,,"Recording everything is a time sink, and those heavy-use weeks are absolute nightmares to coordinate. It's exhausting.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The fixed costs are 280,000 yen, but the fuel spending is completely lopsided. Some of us are paying far more than others.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"Other groups say asking for favors is what ruins things. Also, checking each other's math just makes everyone feel accused.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"The diary shows weekends are way busier than weekdays. Plus, the mechanic says our short trips are killing the battery and brakes.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Servas, if the fuel is lopsided, we definitely can't keep doing what we're doing.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,May,,"@Takumi, that explains the tension. The ""favor"" system is exactly what's draining my energy.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Servas,,Indeed. A simple split isn't fair if the usage is this uneven.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"We need a way to stop the ""asking"" part. That's where the fighting starts.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Kenji,,And we need to account for the wear and tear from those short trips!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Misaki,,I just want to know the car will be ready and clean when it's my turn.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,May,,"If we spend an hour a week just recording runs, I'm out. It's too much work.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Servas,,We must balance the financial burden without creating a culture of suspicion.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Kenji, maybe a fixed schedule would stop the fighting?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"Maybe, but does that solve the money part?","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
