55,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Option A gives me certainty for my weekly trips. I like the idea of fixed days.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,May,,Option A sounds best. No more negotiating every single time we need the keys.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Option C is the most precise for costs, but @Takumi mentioned that checking figures causes conflict.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Takumi,,Exactly. Option C sounds like a recipe for more fighting. I vote for Option A.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Kenji,,"Option C is the most honest about the money, but I don't want us to stop being friends.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Kenji, if we do Option A, the fixed monthly share handles the money simply.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,May,,"Right. It's a flat fee. No more ""who owes what"" for every single trip.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Servas,,Option B puts too much burden on one person. I cannot support that.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Takumi,,"Option A is the cleanest. You have your day, you use it, you don't ask.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Kenji,,I guess the simplicity of Option A is better than the accuracy of Option C if it keeps the peace.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I'm voting A.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,May,,Me too. A is the only way to save my sanity.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Servas,,"I will concede to A for the sake of harmony, though it's less precise.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Takumi,,A it is.,"{""words"":3,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll go with A as well.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
